{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Felix was informed about the [C]Way
[D]He adjourned the hearing that [G]day [D/F#]
[Em]Wait for Lysias to come [C]down
[D]Then I will decide your [G]case
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Days later Felix and Drusil[C]la
[D]Came to hear what Paul would [G]say [D/F#]
